I wondered about this too, so after playing around in wizard mode 
(dropping many blessed smoky [yes smoky, not glowing] potions around 
many monsters) and not seeing any wishes, I finally relented and peeked
in the code:





































The monsters can never use wands of wishing, and will never get a wish
from a djinni.  The comment in the code is:
    /* I suspect few players will be upset that monsters */
    /* can't wish for wands of death here.... */

